B.Ul=new A.M("Forest Gate","Kiko invites you into the forest. Many friends are waiting!","Greet friends with a smile \u2014 and everyone feels happy.",B.H)
B.Xq=new A.M("Murky Lake","This lake is full of plastic trash. The fish look sad.","Clean water keeps fish healthy. Never throw trash in the water!",B.a_)
B.WE=new A.M("Butterfly Flowers","The butterflies are gone. The flowers here are wilting and need care.","Do not pick flowers carelessly \u2014 let them grow for the butterflies.",B.H)
B.Xy=new A.M("Little Mushroom","Mushrooms grow on the old tree. Every creature has its place.","Even small things matter \u2014 respect every living thing.",B.H)
B.V1=new A.M("Trash on the Path","The little path is full of candy wrappers. Let us clean it up!","Put trash in the bin, wherever you are.",B.a_)
B.X5=new A.M("Banyan Tree","The banyan tree is very old, a home for many birds.","Respect the old \u2014 trees, grandparents, and teachers too.",B.af)
B.X4=new A.M("Lost Rabbit","A rabbit ran deep into the forest. Let us look for it slowly.","Help a friend who is lost \u2014 that is a kind heart.",B.H)
B.V9=new A.M("Thirsty Deer","The deer is looking for clean water. Help Kiko protect the spring.","A clean spring keeps every creature healthy.",B.a_)
B.Xk=new A.M("Fruit Garden","The fruit trees bear fruit, but it all fell and was forgotten.","Take just enough, and leave some for others.",B.H)
B.Yt=new A.M("The Owl","The owl guards the forest at night. It calls hoo hoo hoo!","Every creature has a job \u2014 even the ones awake at night.",B.H)
B.Y6=new A.M("Plastic Trash","Lots of plastic is stuck on the branches. Animals can get trapped!","Plastic does not rot \u2014 sort it, never throw it carelessly.",B.a_)
B.Vo=new A.M("Squirrel Leaps","Squirrels leap from tree to tree. They need many whole trees.","Do not break the branches \u2014 they are paths for them.",B.H)
B.Y2=new A.M("Baby Deer","A baby deer lost its mother. Help find her!","A child needs a parent, and a parent needs a loving child.",B.H)
B.UU=new A.M("Dripping Cave","In the cave are lovely stone drips. Look, but do not touch.","Rare and precious things \u2014 admire them, do not break them.",B.a4)
B.Vi=new A.M("Honey Bees","The bees work hard to gather honey. Let us watch from far away.","Hard workers deserve respect. Do not disturb their work.",B.af)
B.Uw=new A.M("Rippling River","The river flows clean again. The fish are back to play!","See the result? Small work each day makes a healthy forest.",B.a_)
B.VH=new A.M("Young Sprout","A new tree sprout starts to grow. One day it will be a big tree.","Small today can be big later. Be patient and caring.",B.H)
B.U4=new A.M("Bird's Nest","A nest sits on a high branch. Look from afar, do not climb up.","Respect other homes \u2014 even a bird's home.",B.af)
B.XP=new A.M("Sun Bear","A sun bear walks by. Give it room, do not shout!","Calm and humble \u2014 that is polite, in the forest and at home.",B.af)
B.TR=new A.M("Rainforest","Rain falls. The leaves get a bath and the forest feels fresh.","Rain is a gift from the sky. Be thankful and use it well.",B.H)
B.XR=new A.M("Caterpillar Changes","The caterpillar goes into its cocoon. Soon it will be a butterfly!","Be patient \u2014 good things need time to grow.",B.H)
B.WA=new A.M("Forest Ranger","The forest ranger arrives. He guards the forest every day.","Respect those who protect nature \u2014 rangers, teachers, grandparents.",B.af)
B.U8=new A.M("Trash in Three","The ranger teaches sorting trash: organic, plastic, hazardous.","Sort your trash from now on \u2014 your home stays clean.",B.a_)
B.WB=new A.M("Blooming Forest","The flowers bloom again. The butterflies are back!","See? The forest blooms because you cared.",B.H)
B.VU=new A.M("Forest Party","All the animals gather. They want to say thank you.",'Thanking each other is lovely. Try saying "thank you" today.',B.H)
B.We=new A.M("Forest Forever","The last day in Kiko's Forest! The final boss awaits.","You are a Forest Keeper now! Bring this good habit into real life.",B.a_)
